## Result
- All P0-43 interactions ran without a console error or page exception; the four committed screenshots are in reviews/evidence/.
- Ink is one SVG in the world above every object, stores token names, survives zoom/theme/language and is cleared only by a reload.
- Rework run: 30/30 assertions passed (masthead EN/DE, undo/redo mid-stroke, normal undo/redo, drag-undo regression).
- Final run: colour survival in one session and the multi-pointer guard passed; one touch stroke = one undo step, redo restores it, and the normal mouse pen/undo/redo still pass.
